Large cards:

**What do you want to check?**
- 💬 Message / OTP — Analyze suspicious messages. (Tier 1)
- 💳 Payment / UPI — Analyze payment requests. (Tier 1)
- 🔗 Website / Link — Analyze suspicious URLs. (Tier 1)
- 🛍️ Online Shop — Check suspicious social-media shops. (Tier 2)
