## 20. SOCIAL MEDIA SUPPORT

Platform selection: Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp, TikTok, Telegram, LinkedIn, X.

Do NOT create seven completely different detection engines — use one common analysis engine. The selected platform simply provides context to the analysis.

