## 33. DO NOT BUILD THESE IN THE MVP

- Real bank integration
- Real payment processing
- Real OTP interception
- Password collection
- Real account hacking
- Surveillance / background monitoring of private messages
- Fake cybersecurity statistics
- Claims of guaranteed detection
- Complex enterprise SOC functionality

Keep the MVP focused.

