## MOST IMPORTANT INSTRUCTION

BUILD THE ACTUAL WORKING APPLICATION, in Tier order (Section 0).

Do not only create a design mockup. Do not only create static HTML screens. Do not generate fake AI responses without explaining that they are demo/fallback responses (use the `"source"` field, Section 13/28).

Implement the backend, frontend, analysis logic, demo data, attack-chain visualization, and Break the Chain workflow.

Prioritize a stable, working Tier-1 MVP over excessive features.

The final result should be something demonstrable to hackathon judges as:

**TRUSTCHAIN AI** — an AI-powered cross-context digital safety platform that helps users detect risk, understand the attack chain, and stop before the damage happens.

**Final tagline:** TRUSTCHAIN AI — Check. Understand. Break the Chain.
